<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN 200-2 AT CLOSE V SRI LANKA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN 200-2 AT CLOSE V SRI LANKA.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan were 200 for the loss of two wickets at close of play on the second day of the first test against Sri Lanka on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 330 (H.Tillekeratna 103, R.Kaluwitharana 57; Saqlain Mushtaq 5-89), Pakistan 200-2.</p>
</text>
